      "summary": "在交流電路中，電感中的電流滯後於電感兩端的電壓90度。",
      "latex": "",
      "pages": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "current-capacitor-ac",
      "label": "電容交流電流",
      "kind": "formula",
      "summary": "交流電路中電容的電流，其峰值由峰值電壓除以容抗得到，且電流超前電壓90度。",
      "latex": "i_C(t) = \\left(\\frac{V_0}{1/\\omega C}\\right) \\sin\\left(\\omega t + \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)",
      "pages": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "capacitive-reactance",
      "label": "容抗",
      "kind": "formula",
      "summary": "電容在交流電路中對電流的阻礙作用，單位為歐姆。",
      "latex": "X_C = \\frac{1}{\\omega C}",
      "pages": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "capacitor-current-leads-voltage",
      "label": "電容電流超前電壓",
      "kind": "principle",
      "summary": "在交流電路中，電容中的電流超前於電容兩端的電壓90度。",
      "latex": "",
      "pages": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "complex-impedance-notation",
      "label": "複數阻抗表示法",
      "kind": "method",
